# Deelbaar — monorepo (pnpm workspaces)

## Layout
- **`apps/core`**: Primary Expo app (`@deelbaar/core`) — expo-router, `app/`, `lib/`, `components/`, `global.css`, `metro.config.js` (Uniwind), `eas.json`. Env: **`apps/core/.env`** (see `apps/core/env-example.txt`).
- **`apps/cms`**: Payload CMS + Next (`@deelbaar/cms`); dev server default port **4000**.
- **Root**: `pnpm copy:payload-types` → `scripts/sync-payload-types.cjs` (copies `apps/cms/src/payload-types.ts` → **`apps/core/src/lib/types/payload-generated.ts`**).
- **Dev both**: `pnpm dev` — Payload/Next on **:4000** (`dev:cms`) + Core Expo dev client (`dev:core`), after `copy:payload-types`.
- **Core only**: `pnpm start` or `pnpm dev:core`. CMS only: `pnpm dev:cms`. Native: `pnpm android` / `pnpm ios`.

## Stack (Core)
- **Expo SDK**: ~55 (dev client: `expo-dev-client`)
- **React Native**: 0.83.x | **React**: 19.2.x
- **Navigation**: `expo-router` (file-based app router; entry `expo-router/entry`)
- **UI**: **HeroUI Native** + **Uniwind** + Tailwind v4 (`global.css`, `heroui-native/styles`). Prefer HeroUI components over bespoke controls; use `useAppColors` / RN `StyleSheet` where native or Mapbox-adjacent styling needs it.
- **Data**: TanStack React Query v5
- **Backend**: Payload CMS via `lib/api/PayloadClient`; generated types synced with **`pnpm copy:payload-types`** (also runs at the start of **`pnpm start`** on Core).
- **Maps**: `@rnmapbox/maps` (Expo plugin in `apps/core/app.json`)
- **On-device / vision**: `@react-native-ml-kit/text-recognition`; helpers under `lib/ai/`
- **Build**: EAS config in **`apps/core/eas.json`**; `extra.eas.projectId` in **`apps/core/app.json`**; `pnpm eas` runs Core local Android EAS build.
- **Package manager**: pnpm 10

## Conventions for the agent
- Prefer **Expo-compatible** APIs; use `npx expo install <pkg>` when adding or upgrading native-related packages so versions match the SDK.
- Match existing patterns: HeroUI Native + Uniwind, expo-router layouts under **`apps/core/app/`**.
- Do not commit secrets; Core config keys belong in **`apps/core/env-example.txt`** (placeholders) and **`apps/core/.env`**. CMS secrets stay in **`apps/cms/.env`**.
- Run **lint** after substantive edits: **`pnpm lint`** (Core `expo lint`).
- See **`apps/core/PARITY_CHECKLIST.md`** for behavior parity vs legacy mobile.
- Strict Payload / API typing: **`.cursor/rules/payload-strict-types.mdc`** (with **`deelbaar-api.mdc`**).
- **Code style (agent):** **`.cursor/rules/agent-code-style.mdc`** — fail fast; no magic numbers/strings (named `const`); minimal comments; clarity via names and structure.
- **Brevity:** **`.cursor/rules/concise-action-answers.mdc`** — ≤8 lines default; expand only if they ask (*explain*, *details*, …).
- **UI verify:** **`.cursor/rules/verify-ui-copy-with-screenshot.mdc`** — layout contract + **Layout proof** before “done”; screenshot optional.
- Product vision: **`docs/PRODUCT_VISION.md`**.

## Skills
- Project skills live under `.cursor/skills/` (e.g. Callstack **agent-skills** at `.cursor/skills/agent-skills`). Use `/` in Agent chat to pick skills by name when relevant.
